# Manual-maintenance newsyslog profile for the AMC learning worker.
#
# Do NOT install this example in /etc/newsyslog.d: launchd opens the stdout and
# stderr file descriptors only when it starts the child. Periodic rotation
# without first stopping the job would leave the worker writing to the renamed
# inode. Follow deploy/launchd/README.md: gate intake, bootout the worker, run a
# dry-run and forced rotation with this file, then bootstrap and verify progress.
#
# logfile                                      owner:group mode count size-KiB when flags
/var/log/kapy/amc12-learning-worker.stdout.log ss:staff   600  7     10240    $D0  NZ
/var/log/kapy/amc12-learning-worker.stderr.log ss:staff   600  14    10240    $D0  NZ
